Don't panic for psion 3a.

This app display the large friendly words Don't Panic
on the screen when you switch on. It also plays the
sound effect of the HHGttG coming on, if the sample
is present.

The following files are supplied:

\opl\Panic.opl - the program source
\pic\Panic.pic - the don't panic bitmap
\pic\Dp.pic    - the application icon
\wve\on.wve    - the sound effect

Edit the opl file to give the location of the above files.
I use a flash ram card in drive a, so you may need to alter
the filenames in the opl file.

Translate the program and install in the normal way. Run the
application and the Don't Panic piccy will appear. Return to
the system screen, or another application, and when you next
switch on ...

Don't Panic!

If the psion is in the middle of updating lists when you switch
off, it may take a second or two for the don't panic to appear
when you next switch on - so _don't panic_!


